flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> RoleSelect[Splash / Role Select Screen]

    RoleSelect -->|Reader| ReaderLogin[Reader Login]
    RoleSelect -->|Staff| StaffLogin[Staff Login]

    ReaderLogin <-->|Switch portal| StaffLogin

    %% Reader Flow
    ReaderLogin -->|No account| Register[Register Screen]
    ReaderLogin -->|Forgot password| ForgotPwdReader[Reader Forgot Password]
    ReaderLogin -->|Login success| ReaderHome([Reader Home])

    %% Staff Flow
    StaffLogin -->|Forgot password| ForgotPwdStaff[Staff Forgot Password]
    StaffLogin -->|Login success| StaffHome([Staff Dashboard])

    %% Registration (Reader)
    Register -->|Submit form| VerifyRegister[Verify OTP / Email]
    VerifyRegister -->|Success| RegSuccess[Registration Success]
    RegSuccess --> ReaderLogin
    Register -->|Already have account| ReaderLogin

    %% Forgot Password - Reader
    ForgotPwdReader -->|Enter email or phone| OtpReader[Verify OTP]
    OtpReader -->|Valid OTP| ResetPwdReader[Reset Password]
    ResetPwdReader -->|Success| ReaderLogin
    ForgotPwdReader -->|Back| ReaderLogin

    %% Forgot Password - Staff
    ForgotPwdStaff -->|Enter internal email| OtpStaff[Verify OTP]
    OtpStaff -->|Valid OTP| ResetPwdStaff[Reset Password]
    ResetPwdStaff -->|Success| StaffLogin
    ForgotPwdStaff -->|Back| StaffLogin
